msgid "ABI 与系统调用"
msgstr "ABI and system calls"

msgid "入口与错误"
msgstr "Entry points and errors"

msgid ""
"x86_64 使用 Linux syscall 编号和寄存器约定：rax 为编号，参数为 rdi/rsi/rdx/r10/r8/r9，返回负 errno 表示失败。未知接口返回 ENOSYS； "
"应用不能从一个编号存在推断其全部 Linux 行为。POSIX 用户态应优先使用 libc。 指针、容量、枚举、版本及授权由内核最终检查。"
msgstr ""
"x86_64 uses Linux syscall numbers and register conventions: rax holds the number, "
"rdi/rsi/rdx/r10/r8/r9 hold arguments, and a negative errno return indicates failure. Unknown "
"interfaces return ENOSYS; applications must not infer complete Linux behavior from the existence "
"of a number. POSIX userspace should prefer libc. The kernel performs final checks of pointers, "
"capacities, enumerations, versions, and authorization."

msgid "系统调用声明与编号位于内核导出的 UAPI，公开扩展位于主仓 include/reliefos。 用户态只消费 headers_install 的白名单结果，不复制内核私有布局。"
msgstr ""
"System-call declarations and numbers are in the kernel-exported UAPI; public extensions are in "
"this repository's include/reliefos. Userspace consumes only the allowlisted headers_install "
"output, without copying private kernel layouts."

msgid "版本与兼容"
msgstr "Versions and compatibility"

msgid ""
"公开结构用定宽字段；扩展要处理调用方大小、版本和错误，不传内核指针。 规范扩展库为 ``libreliefos.so.2``，旧 ``libleonos.so.2`` 是独立兼容库， "
"不能简单把旧库变成新库符号链接。既有 leonos 转发头、符号与冻结协议值在 明确支持处保留，不代表允许新增旧命名接口。"
msgstr ""
"Public structures use fixed-width fields; extensions must handle caller size, version, and errors "
"without passing kernel pointers. The canonical extension library is ``libreliefos.so.2``; old "
"``libleonos.so.2`` is a separate compatibility library and cannot simply become a symlink to the "
"new library. Existing leonos forwarding headers, symbols, and frozen protocol values remain where "
"explicitly supported; this does not permit adding interfaces with old names."

msgid ""
"早期产品激活接口已退役：不再提供联网验证、离线密钥、许可证状态或对应的 旧名称别名，SDK 也不再导出这些声明。依赖旧激活接口的应用需要移除调用后 "
"重新编译；兼容验证将这组接口列为已退役，要求当前库中不存在这些符号。 历史 ABI 基线保留原记录。独立的硬件信息接口与 标准 DMI/sysfs 查询继续提供，不涉及产品激活。"
msgstr ""
"Early product-activation interfaces are retired: online verification, offline keys, license "
"status, and corresponding old-name aliases are no longer provided, and the SDK no longer exports "
"their declarations. Applications depending on them must remove calls and recompile. Compatibility "
"validation marks these interfaces as retired and requires their symbols to be absent from current "
"libraries. Historical ABI baselines retain their records. Separate hardware-information interfaces"
" and standard DMI/sysfs queries remain available and do not involve product activation."

msgid ""
"驱动服务表当前为版本 2、304 字节；测试保留 168 字节历史前缀并单独冻结 版本 2 的追加字段。旧版本驱动描述符在初始化前拒绝，不能将前缀保留视为 旧驱动二进制兼容；见 "
":doc:`../admin-guide/limitations`。 调用约定一致不等于所有结构布局或行为已完整认证。"
msgstr ""
"The driver service table is currently version 2 and 304 bytes. Tests retain the historical "
"168-byte prefix and separately freeze version 2's appended fields. Old-version driver descriptors "
"are rejected before initialization; preserving the prefix does not establish binary compatibility "
"with old drivers. See :doc:`../admin-guide/limitations`. Matching calling conventions do not "
"constitute full certification of all structure layouts or behavior."

msgid "进程、时间与描述符"
msgstr "Processes, time, and descriptors"

msgid ""
"execve/execveat 的参数、环境和初始栈限制由 ReliefNT 的现行契约定义； fd 时间戳操作按打开的 inode 身份执行。文件访问模式、O_PATH 和能力不能绕过。 "
"vDSO 提供已实现的时间接口，失败或不支持的时钟保留 syscall 路线。 源文件与运行模型见内核 ``Documentation/userspace-api/``。"
msgstr ""
"ReliefNT's current contract defines execve/execveat argument, environment, and initial-stack "
"limits; fd timestamp operations act on the identity of the opened inode. File access modes, "
"O_PATH, and capabilities cannot be bypassed. The vDSO provides implemented time interfaces, "
"retaining the syscall path for failures or unsupported clocks. For sources and the runtime model, "
"see the kernel's ``Documentation/userspace-api/``."

msgid "X11 应用通过 Xorg 通信。未知或旧兼容路径不能当作新的公开接口。"
msgstr ""
"X11 applications communicate through Xorg. Unknown or old compatibility paths must not be treated "
"as new public interfaces."

msgid "兼容名称分类"
msgstr "Compatibility-name categories"

msgid "品牌检查对旧名称按精确文件路径登记，不使用整目录豁免："
msgstr "Brand checks register old names by exact file path, without directory-wide exemptions:"

msgid "compatibility：已有符号、SONAME、磁盘/协议字节值及转发头。"
msgstr ""
"compatibility: existing symbols, SONAMEs, disk/protocol byte values, and forwarding headers."

msgid "history：明确的历史事实或源码迁移映射，不是当前产品显示名。"
msgstr ""
"history: explicit historical facts or source-migration mappings, not current product display "
"names."

msgid "external-url：实际仍使用的外部 URL，不能未经迁移擅自改名。"
msgstr ""
"external-url: external URLs still in actual use, which must not be renamed without migration."

msgid "attribution：第三方作者、许可和来源原文。"
msgstr "attribution: original third-party authorship, license, and provenance text."

msgid "migration：尚待完成的过渡项，严格发布检查必须单独审阅。"
msgstr "migration: unfinished transitions requiring separate review in strict release checks."

msgid "文档迁移只移除已删除文件的登记；无关的既有失败不因目录改名而豁免。"
msgstr ""
"Documentation migration removes registrations only for deleted files; unrelated existing failures "
"receive no exemption from a directory rename."

msgid "旧窗口接口移除"
msgstr "Removal of old window interfaces"

msgid ""
"旧自研窗口、鼠标区域、外观广播和 UI 工具包导出已移除，不再提供转发或空实现。 集成验证要求已移除的图形接口不存在，并继续检查 其他接口的布局、符号类型和 SONAME。进程/时钟与 fbdev"
" 辅助声明分别位于 ``<reliefos/system.h>`` 和 ``<reliefos/fb.h>``，应用必须重新构建。"
msgstr ""
"Exports for old in-house windows, mouse regions, appearance broadcasts, and UI toolkits have been "
"removed, without forwarding or stub implementations. Integration validation requires removed "
"graphics interfaces to be absent and continues checking layouts, symbol types, and SONAMEs of "
"other interfaces. Process/clock and fbdev helper declarations are in ``<reliefos/system.h>`` and "
"``<reliefos/fb.h>`` respectively; applications must rebuild."

msgid "引导与构建接口收敛"
msgstr "Consolidation of boot and build interfaces"

msgid ""
"开机前的交互诊断会话、独立载荷、SDK 控制接口和旧名称别名已整体移除。 系统信息应用只显示版本信息，内核直接进入正常初始化流程。 "
"依赖已删除控制接口的程序必须移除调用并重新构建，不提供兼容空实现。 ABI 清单同步删除这些已退役条目，其余结构布局、常量和符号约定保持不变。 "
"内核安装包只要求内核与独立符号文件；版本化启动目录保留内核、initramfs 和 引导环境文件。构建调试配置、符号定位、串口日志及 panic 报告继续可用。"
msgstr ""
"Pre-boot interactive diagnostic sessions, standalone payloads, SDK control interfaces, and old-"
"name aliases have all been removed. The system-information application shows only version "
"information, and the kernel enters normal initialization directly. Programs depending on removed "
"control interfaces must remove calls and rebuild; no compatibility stubs are provided. ABI "
"manifests remove these retired entries while preserving all other structure layouts, constants, "
"and symbol conventions. Kernel installation packages require only the kernel and separate symbol "
"file; versioned boot directories retain the kernel, initramfs, and boot-environment file. Build "
"debug configurations, symbol lookup, serial logs, and panic reports remain available."

msgid "独立安装实例的引导接口"
msgstr "Boot interfaces for independent installation instances"

msgid ""
"``<reliefos/bootloader.h>`` 保持原有 ``reliefos_boot_install_options`` 布局及旧接口， 新增 "
"``reliefos_boot_prepare_instance`` 创建带所有权标记的根 PARTUUID 命名目录， ``reliefos_boot_validate_instance`` "
"只读核对该目录和物理 ESP 的实际 inode， ``reliefos_boot_install_instance_at_root`` 发布实例内核、菜单及独立 EFI 文件。 "
"新接口显式传入物理 ESP；``boot_dir`` 可为实例目录的 bind 挂载点。 目录遍历拒绝 symlink，未知目录内容不能被认作本安装器所有。 低层内核包发布还会核对实例标记中的 "
"PARTUUID 与实际根设备，防止跨实例更新。 原有直接挂载 ESP 到 ``/boot`` 的系统继续使用旧接口，不改变其现有文件布局。"
msgstr ""
"``<reliefos/bootloader.h>`` preserves the existing ``reliefos_boot_install_options`` layout and "
"old interfaces. New ``reliefos_boot_prepare_instance`` creates an ownership-marked directory named"
" by root PARTUUID; ``reliefos_boot_validate_instance`` performs read-only checks of that directory"
" and actual inodes on the physical ESP; ``reliefos_boot_install_instance_at_root`` publishes the "
"instance kernel, menu, and separate EFI file. New interfaces explicitly take the physical ESP; "
"``boot_dir`` may be a bind mount of the instance directory. Directory traversal rejects symlinks, "
"and unknown contents must not be treated as installer-owned. Low-level kernel-package publication "
"also checks the marker's PARTUUID against the actual root device to prevent cross-instance "
"updates. Existing systems mounting ESP directly on ``/boot`` continue using old interfaces without"
" changing their file layout."

msgid "第三方库拆分"
msgstr "Separation of third-party libraries"

msgid ""
"zlib、libpng、mbedTLS 3 已从扩展库的对象集合移到各自官方共享库；公开的 ReliefOS 接口与旧 leonos 别名继续保留，链接器应显式链接使用的第三方库。旧扩展库偶然 "
"导出的厂商内部符号、旧私有 mbedTLS 配置及 ``sqlite.so.3`` VFS 不属于稳定兼容 接口。使用这些实现细节的程序须用 SDK 里的匹配头文件重编译；SQLite 使用标准 "
"``libsqlite3.so.0`` POSIX VFS。历史 ABI 快照保持原样，兼容检查继续覆盖第一方接口。"
msgstr ""
"zlib, libpng, and mbedTLS 3 have moved out of extension-library object sets into their official "
"shared libraries. Public ReliefOS interfaces and old leonos aliases remain; linkers should "
"explicitly link the third-party libraries used. Accidentally exported vendor-internal symbols, old"
" private mbedTLS configurations, and the ``sqlite.so.3`` VFS are not stable compatibility "
"interfaces. Programs relying on these implementation details must recompile with matching SDK "
"headers; SQLite uses standard ``libsqlite3.so.0`` POSIX VFS. Historical ABI snapshots stay "
"unchanged, and compatibility checks continue covering first-party interfaces."
